    <Markdown>
## Post-SBA Survey

The following questions will ask you about the Scenario-based Activity (SBA) interface and the content of the SBA. The SBA interface is the system in which you completed the SBA assignment for this course. When considering interface questions, please consider the usability of the system, such as moving from screen to screen, interacting with the text boxes, and reading or accessing the content. When considering content questions, please consider how you feel regarding the content of the SBA and how it relates to this course and your understanding.

There are 18 questions total, and this should take about 10 minutes to complete.
    </Markdown>
    
    <Vertical>
      <Markdown>
### How much do you agree or disagree with the following statements regarding your experience with the SBA in this course?

**I thought the SBA interface was easy to use.**
      </Markdown>
      <ChoiceInput id="interdisciplinary_post_survey_1">
        <Key>Strongly Disagree</Key>
        <Key>Disagree</Key>
        <Key>Neutral</Key>
        <Key>Agree</Key>
        <Key>Strongly Agree</Key>
      </ChoiceInput>
    </Vertical>

    <Vertical>
      <Markdown>
